OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and light rain initially
OL,6,Faround the east coast, which clears
OL,7,Fbefore mid-morning. Otherwise a day of
OL,8,Fsunny spells and a few isolated light
OL,9,Fshowers, most of these confined across
OL,10,Fthe far west and north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry with clear spells
OL,13,Fmost widespread in the east, but a few
OL,14,Fscattered light showers appearing west
OL,15,Fand north of Lough Neagh. Southwest
OL,16,Fwinds freshening overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
