OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMost in east staying dry
OL,6,Fwith best of the brighter spells
OL,7,Fappearing through the morning and
OL,8,Ftowards the east coast. Scattered
OL,9,Fshowers in the west, building during
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,13,FUnsettled for Sunday with strong
OL,14,Fwinds, rain then showers. Most dry on
OL,15,FMonday with showers generally confined
OL,16,Fto the far west. Tuesday turning wet
OL,17,Fand windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
